  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Development and Food Security (EDFS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support partners&apos; efforts in food security  sustainable development by empowering marginalised communities to overcome poverty and build resilience against climate change. Leveraging NCA&#x2019;s strong partnerships with faith-based organisations and technical experts, it will improve agricultural productivity, market access, and business skills, while fostering vocational training and entrepreneurship in rural and urban settings.</narrative>
  </description>
